   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Safety rules",
   "items": [
    "Input, then protection, every 20 ms tick",
    "E-stop from either link latches; clear only from the source in control",
    "Both links claiming control: conflict, robot sleeps",
    "Calibration only in Calibrate, ±30° of defaults, 60°/s"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Link protocol v2",
   "items": [
    "Commands 50 Hz, telemetry 10 Hz, CRC-16 frames",
